  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Easy Magic 让物品在关闭附魔台界面后仍能留在其中。这些物品还会在附魔台方块周围漂浮渲染。此外，附魔界面增加了一个按钮，可以以极低成本重新随机当前提供的附魔选项。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需将青金石和待附魔物品留在附魔界面中：它们会精美地漂浮在方块周围渲染！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以少量青金石和少许经验值（而非等级！）为代价，重新随机当前提供的附魔选项。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在附魔界面中可预览你将在物品上获得的附魔数量。默认保持为一个。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">书架和附魔台之间的方块不再强制为空气；任何没有碰撞箱的方块（如火把或高草丛）现在都可以正常工作。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">达到最高等级附魔所需的书架数量可从 15 个起自由配置减少。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将本模组添加至现有世界后，只需破坏并重新放置你的附魔台即可！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果与你的资源包冲突，可在配置中禁用重新随机按钮。所有功能仍将保持不变！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Apotheosis</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Quark</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 中的矩阵附魔器不兼容。</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端和服务端均需安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge 均需）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 环境）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 环境）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内通过 Mod Menu 进行配置（需安装 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，该模组由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 开发，仅限 Fabric 环境）。请注意，在旧版 Minecraft 中，还需安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有配置文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 文件夹中，命名格式为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型都对每个模组存在。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Forge_User_41096743\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">csb987</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lapis-stays-in-the-enchanting-table\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Lapis Stays in the Enchanting Table</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组中率先提出了将物品存储在附魔台中的创意。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vazkii\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Vazkii</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 提供的浮动物品栏渲染代码，该代码取自其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Botania</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组中的符文祭坛渲染器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/draylar1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Draylar</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reroll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Reroll</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组中提出了锁定附魔重随花费的创意。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/johnsmith_474\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">JohnSmith_474</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在其出色的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-overhauled\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enchanting Overhauled</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模组中激发了重随机按钮的设计灵感。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sheep-variety\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sheepvariety/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
